  "releaseNotes": "Added RasterImageLoader for PNG and BMP loading from files and readable streams. PNG supports 8- and 16-bit grayscale and RGBA, all scanline filters, and Adam7 interlacing. BMP supports uncompressed indexed 8-bit and 32-bit BGRA images, including top-down images. Loaded rasters preserve sample values and use bottom-up Y coordinates; caller streams remain open. PNG export now throws ArgumentOutOfRangeException for non-positive raster dimensions. Existing geometry API signatures are unchanged.",
